    Fix EvidenceBundle.test_validity items to inline the object schema
    
    The items schema used a $ref to #/$defs/TestValidityEntry, so
    additionalProperties and properties were not directly accessible on
    the items object itself (only after resolving the ref). AC-11 checks
    item.additionalProperties and item.properties directly, so inline the
    object schema in place instead of referencing the def.
    
